(PROJECT STRUCTURE REPORT) Tj T*
(StayBy - accommodation booking application) Tj T*
(Generated: 2026-10-23 14:21) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. PROJECT OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(StayBy is organized as a full-stack application:) Tj T*
(  Backend: Spring Boot REST API in Java, with JPA, PostgreSQL, Spring Security/JWT,) Tj T*
(           email, PayHere payments, image uploads, and PDF receipt/refund services.) Tj T*
(  Frontend: React and TypeScript application built with Vite, Tailwind CSS, Leaflet,) Tj T*
(            React Router, and Lucide icons.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. TECHNOLOGY SUMMARY) Tj T*
(  Backend build: Maven Wrapper \(backend/mvnw and backend/mvnw.cmd\)) Tj T*
(  Backend runtime: Java 21; Spring Boot 4.1.1) Tj T*
(  Database: PostgreSQL via Spring Data JPA/Hibernate) Tj T*
(  Frontend package manager/build: npm and Vite) Tj T*
(  Frontend runtime: React ^19.2.8) Tj T*
(  Authentication: Spring Security resource server and JWT service) Tj T*
(  Payments: PayHere integration) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. BACKEND ORGANIZATION) Tj T*
(  config/       Web and application configuration) Tj T*
(  controller/   HTTP REST endpoints grouped by business capability) Tj T*
(  dto/          Request and response transfer objects) Tj T*
(  entity/       JPA persistence entities and status/role enums) Tj T*
(  repository/   Spring Data repository interfaces) Tj T*
(  security/     JWT and Spring Security configuration) Tj T*
(  service/      Business logic, scheduling, mail, payment, image, and PDF services) Tj T*
(  resources/    application.properties and runtime configuration) Tj T*
(  test/         Backend application tests) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. FRONTEND ORGANIZATION) Tj T*
(  components/   Shared navigation, landing-page, and reusable UI components) Tj T*
(  pages/        Traveler, owner, and administrator screens) Tj T*
(  services/     HTTP/API service modules by domain) Tj T*
(  assets/       Bundled images and SVG assets) Tj T*
(  public/       Public favicon and icon resources) Tj T*
(  App.tsx       Application routes and top-level composition) Tj T*
(  main.tsx      Browser entry point) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. CONFIGURATION AND DATA SAFETY) Tj T*
(  Environment-specific secrets are referenced through backend/.env and ${...} placeholders.) Tj T*
(  Secret values and passwords are not included in this report.) Tj T*
(  Uploaded images, dependency installations, and compiled build output are summarized) Tj T*
(  rather than embedded in the PDF.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. COMPLETE DIRECTORY TREE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
